:: j2 [j2 shin-gobee-desert map]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box'>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Look around->j2: description]]</li>
      <li>[[Approach the oasis.->j2: oasis]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'j2'>><<s>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'j2'>>
</div>

:: j2: description [j2 explore]
<img class='concept' src='images/story/cactuspatch.png'>
<p>After plodding for hours through the sun-baked desert for what seems like hours, you come to a wide open area spotted with cacti.</p>
<p>As the path comes to an end, you spot an inviting oasis on the horizon... or is it just a mirage?</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
</ul>

:: j2: oasis
<p>It seems real enough once you get closer. The small pond is surrounded by cacti of various sizes. A hooded figure is crounched near one of them.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Approach the hooded figure.->j2: zahara]]</li>
  <li>[[Continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
</ul>

:: j2: zahara
<p>You spot a lone figure crouched in a grove of cacti in the blazing sun. They are wearing a golden scarf and loose grey clothing.</p>
<p>As you step closer, they reach up and pull down their hood, revealing flowing, white hair and a deep brown complexion.</p>
<p>You recognize the person as Zahara, the head teacher of the Bloom School. Her hands move quickly as she hums to herself, engrossed in some task.</p>
<p>Without turning from the cactus she's currently focused on, Zahara says, "Greetings. Welcome to my cactus garden. I call it "The Factor Patch".</p>
<p>"Want to hear a cactus joke?"</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[I have no choice, do I?->zahara: joke]]</li>
  <li>[[Isn't it a little hot for jokes?->zahara: grandma]]</li>
</ul>

:: zahara: joke [j2 zahara]
<p>"You always have a choice. It's just that you've already made your choice by coming here." she turns and flashes a sly smirk.</p>
<p>"How did the cactus get an A+ on their test?"</p>
<p>She doesn't even give you a chance to respond before the punchline.</p>
<p>"Because they were a really sharp student!"</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Do cacti even go to school?->zahara: joke 2]]</li>
  <li>[[Laugh politely.->zahara: grandma]]</li>
</ul>

:: zahara: joke 2
<p>"Ah. Well, I guess you have a POINT there. But really, there's no need to NEEDLE me about it!"</p>
<p>She bursts into a laughter. Even her chuckles have a strange musical quality.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Wait for her to stop laughing.->zahara: grandma]]</li>
</ul>

:: zahara: grandma
<p>Zahara stands up and begins petting her scarf.</p>
<p>Suddenly, it moves, and you realize that it's actually a Mergimal! The enormous Tubra slithers down her body and nuzzles her feet.</p>
<p>"This is Grandma. She's very friendly."</p>
<p>"What brings you out to the deep desert?"</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[I am trying to complete the Mergimal School Challenge.->zahara: cactori]]</li>
  <li>[[I am looking for Grace, the Veil School leader->zahara: grace]]</li>
  <li>[[I was just wandering and heard you humming.->zahara: music]]</li>
</ul>

:: zahara: cactori
<p>"You walked here straight from the Consevatory? That gardener told you where I was, didn't he?"</p>
<p>"Well, as long as you're here, I could use some help with my cacti.</p>
<p>They're actually 'Cactori'...Factor cacti. They can only grow with the power of factors.</p>
<p>Can you pick a cactus and guide the factor tree until it blooms?</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Ask how it works.->zahara: lesson]]</li>
</ul>
